  @doc ~S"""
  This method changes the `CSS media type` through the `:media` option, and/or the `'prefers-colors-scheme'` media feature, using the `:color_scheme` option.

  **Usage**

  ```elixir
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('screen').matches")
  # => true
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('print').matches")
  # => false

  Page.emulate_media!(page, media: :print)
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('screen').matches")
  # => false
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('print').matches")
  # => true

  # `:null` (JS `null`) removes the emulation, leaving `:media` out keeps it.
  Page.emulate_media!(page, media: :null)
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('screen').matches")
  # => true
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('print').matches")
  # => false
  ```

  ```elixir
  Page.emulate_media!(page, color_scheme: :dark)
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches")
  # => true
  Page.evaluate!(page, "() => matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches")
  # => false
  ```

  *Since Playwright 1.8.*

  ## Options

  * `:color_scheme` (`:null` | `:light` | `:dark` | `:no_preference`) - *Since Playwright 1.9.* Emulates [prefers-colors-scheme](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/prefers-color-scheme) media feature, supported values are `:light` and `:dark`. Passing
    `:null` disables color scheme emulation. `:no_preference` is deprecated.
  * `:contrast` (`:null` | `:no_preference` | `:more`) - *Since Playwright 1.51.* Emulates `'prefers-contrast'` media feature, supported values are `:no_preference`, `:more`. Passing `:null` disables contrast emulation.
  * `:forced_colors` (`:null` | `:active` | `:none`) - *Since Playwright 1.15.* Emulates `'forced-colors'` media feature, supported values are `:active` and `:none`. Passing `:null` disables forced colors emulation.
  * `:media` (`:null` | `:screen` | `:print`) - *Since Playwright 1.9.* Changes the CSS media type of the page. The only allowed values are `:screen`, `:print` and `:null`.
    Passing `:null` disables CSS media emulation.
  * `:reduced_motion` (`:null` | `:reduce` | `:no_preference`) - *Since Playwright 1.12.* Emulates `'prefers-reduced-motion'` media feature, supported values are `:reduce`, `:no_preference`. Passing `:null` disables reduced motion emulation.
  """
